#4401
Clarence~
Clarence~
Clarence is standing here working to get his wings.~
Yes, this is Clarence from "It's a Wonderful Life."  Since the movie is
so popular and overplayed during the Christmas holidays, Clarence has
lost his wings.  He stands here with a very mournful face, hoping that with
each sale, will earn him his wings so he can leave.  It's been almost two
centuries that he has been here, and he has gotten used to the work.
He doesn't seem to want to leave anymore.
~
2|4096|16384|65536|ACT_RACE
8|2048|16777216
1000 S
1 1 1 1d1+24 1d1+14
0 0
7 7 1
>greet_prog 15~
say Can you help me get my wings?
~
>speech_prog wings~
say What I need to do is help someone real well in order to get my wings.
~
>speech_prog help~
say Sorry, God hasn't told me yet what i need to do, exactly.  Try back
say later. I might have some ideas then.
~
|
#4402
Billy~
Billy~
Billy stands here trying to shoot your eyes out.~
Billy's mom always said that he couldn't get a BB gun for christmas
because he would shoot his eyes out.  Well, when he got older, he
decided to buy his own weapon shop, and let people have the opportunity
of shooting their own eyes out, no matter how old they were.~
2|4096|16384|65536|ACT_RACE
8|2048|16777216
