1 1 1 1d1+24 1d1+14
0 0
7 7 1
>greet_prog 25~
say My momma always said I'd shoot my eyes out. So you better be careful
say when playing with your toys.
~
>rand_prog 10~
say Ya know, y'all can make nice stuff out of reindeer pelts.
~
>speech_prog reindeer pelts~
say If i had a pelt i could show y'all how.
say Y'alls need a skinning knife to get pelts though.
~
>give_prog i4446~
mpjunk i4446
smile $n
mpecho Billy pulls out a knife and cuts up the pelt.
if rand(75)
 mpoload 4434
endif
if rand(75)
 mpoload 4435
endif
if rand(75)
  mpoload 4436
endif
drop i4434
drop i4435
drop i4436
say that was the best i could do.
~
|
