>all_greet_prog 100~
tell $n Good Morning. Hope you having a nice day!
if quest(1,4,$n) == 14
  tell $n Thanks again for finding all my ornaments!
endif
if quest(1,4,$n) == 1
 if actorhasobjnum(4466)
   tell $n I see you got an Ornament box!
   tell $n May i have it?
 endif
endif
~
>rand_prog 15~
say It sure would be nice to have a Christmas TREE in
say here with a bunch of ORNAMENTS.
~
>speech_prog tree~
say You can find trees growing outside the village.
say Can't find any ORNAMENTS without a tree you know.
say They seem to be attracted to Christmas trees.
~
>speech_prog ornaments~
say Yeah, I always wanted a set of the 12 days of 
say Christmas Ornaments that Mrs. Fields sold awhile
say ago.  You probably would have to search real hard
say to find a BOX and a full SET.
~
>speech_prog set~
say Will you try to get me a full set of ornaments?
~
>speech_prog box~
say Boxes are easy to get, but ornaments are not.
~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest (1,4,$n) == 0
  mpmset $n quest 1 4 1
  Say Thank you for helping me $n.
  Say Please bring me any ornaments that you may find!
else
  say Sorry you can't help me...
endif
~
>speech_prog p I am not in the mood.~
mpmset $n quest 1 4 0
tell $n I am very sorry you couldnt help me.
~
>speech_prog search~
tell $n People from time to time throw out ornaments.
tell $n If you have a tree, and ATTRACT in the right spots,
tell $n you might get lucky and find an ornament.
tell $n If you do, please let me have it okay.
~
>give_prog I4466~
  if quest (1,4,$n) == 1
    mpmset $n quest 1 4 2
    tell $n Now I have the special limited edition ornament box!
    tell $n When I get the ORNAMENTS, I'll have somewhere to put them!
    tell $n Now all you need is a TREE to ATTRACT them with!
    bounce
    hum
    say On the first day of Christmas, my true love gave to me:
  else 
    sigh
    say Why are you giving me this box?  I have no Ornaments
    say to put in there so please take it back.
    give i4466 $n 
  endif~
>give_prog I4451~
  if quest (1,4,$n) == 2
    mpmset $n quest 1 4 3
    tell $n Thanks!  One down and eleven to go!
    bounce
    emote puts the coin in a box.
    mpquiet on
    mpjunk I4451
    mpquiet off 
    hum
    say On the second day of Christmas, my true love gave to me:
