#4409
Frosty~
Frosty~
Frosty the snowman stands here.~
Frosty the snowman is a jolly happy soul.  With his corncob pipe and a
button nose, and two eys made of coal.  He is a fairytale they say.  He is
made of snow, but the children know, how he came to life one day.  There
must have been some magic in that old silk hat they found.  For when they
placed it on his head, he began to dance around.
~
