     tell $n Man, I can't believe you did all those chores!
     tell $n You really need to find a hard working wife
     tell $n if you know what I mean.
     tell $n Here, take this special whip as your payment.
     tell $n You REALLY deserve a weapon like this.
     mpoload 4432
     give i4432 $n
     tell $n By the way, have you visited the oracle yet?
     shout I want to announce that $n is trully whipped!
   else
     cheek $n
     tell $n Wow, if I wasn't such a playboy, I'd ask you to marry me!
     tell $n Girls that do housework like you are very rare!!
     tell $n Okay, take this nice pen as your reward.
     tell $n Remember that the pen is mighter than the sword.
     mpoload 4422
     give i4422 $n
     tell $n By the way, have you visited the oracle yet?
   endif
endif
if quest(5,4,$n) == 13
  tell $n You must be addicted!
  tell $n Here, Give this back to her.
  mpoload 4445
  give robe $n
  mpmset $n quest 5 4 14
endif
