#4401
A Mountain Trail~
{170}As you leave the icy landing behind you, the world looks smaller and smaller 
as you walk toward the enormous mountain range until it is all that you see 
before you.  As it gets colder and colder, you wonder if there is anything 
alive in this vast, barren, snow covered plain.  Even the trees don't dare 
to make noise as you struggle by.~
