#4402
A Path through the mountains~
{170}This path through the beautiful mountain never seems to be getting
anywhere. The mountains can't get any larger in your prespective, but you
don't seem to be making any headway.  You stop to catch your breath, 
and see the faint sight of smoke coming from around the mountain.  As
you take a deep breath, you detect the faint smell of woodsmoke.~
