#4403
A Snow Covered Path~
{170}As you begin to climb the mountain, you occassionaly hear what sounds like
Christmas carols.  You can also hear shrieks of laughter that seem to
remind you of the snowball fights when you were younger.  The mountains
tower over you. As you look closer, you can barely make out a path in the 
snow.  The path appears to lead north into a valley.  You get a strong 
feeling that this is where the sounds are coming from.~
