#4404
Top of the Mountain~
{170}The scenery robs you of all thought and reason.  With the hard journey
behind you, you take a moment to enjoy the peaceful mountainside, the
various lakes and valleys that surrond the mountain range.  There appears
to be a village on the northside of the mountainside, that must be the source
of all the songs and laughter you heard earlier.~
