little guardhouse.  That kind of reminds you of your last grade school
Christmas play.  The brightly covered house is snuggled into a snow bank
that surrounds it.  The toy soldiers that you see in the window, look at
you and wave.  It seems they don't want to leave their nice warm office
to come outside and greet you.
