#4407
Spells 'R Us~
The shop is covered by a fabric tarp that keeps the brillant sunlight from
fading and damaging the merchandise.  In the far distance, you can see the
fabulous mountain range that you just came through.  The local townspeople
need a lot of help with magic items, even though they are of a magical
nature since they deal with the Christmas season day and day out, 365 1/4
days a year.  The smells of christmas pine, frankensense and mir, waft 
around you as you peruse the merchandise.  The faint muttering and the 
occasional cursing, along with the random and frequent explosions do not 
inspire you to search beyond the counter.~
