#4414
Swan Fountain~
Here in the center of the circle plaza, stands a beautiful ice sculpture.
The tall, opaque piece of ice is carved into a Swan.  The Swan's wings are
gently unfurled, and the water dripping from the wings is caught in the
reservoir that the townspeople gather for their drinking water.  Even
though the sculpture has been in the full heat of the sun, it appears that
not much of it has melted.  The magics of this place must be strong, if
they can prevent ice from completely melting.~
