fire flickers in the fireplace.  On the mantle there are four intricately
carved busts.  Under each there is a name: Rapscallion, Blackeye, Pinkus,
Shiner.  In the far corner you see two tapped kegs.  A group of mugs is
stacked beside them.  As you look closer you realize there is a mug for
each member of the Christmas clan. A ladder lead to the loft Above.~
