#4451
Fiest's House~
Upon entering this home, you become mesmerised by the sight of
literally thousands of brightly colored Christmas lights skillfully
arranged across the hall, fixing the room with an ever shifting parody of
colors.  Looking around, you feel enveloped in warmth as you notice friends
and family start to gather around the hall, reminiscing times gone by, the
sweet sounds of children's laughter in the background beckoning you to
stay and join in the joy and celebration.
    {120}A rather decent Christmas TREE stands in the center of the hall. 
    {121}You notice a large neon sign at the far end of the hall.~
