christmas tree~
The tree is covered with glittering jewels and delightful trinkets, promising
treasureS HIDEN within it's intertwining branches.  Dozens of hand wrapped
gifts lie CASCAded beneath the tree, and you suddenly feel an urge to unwrap
one.~
