#4452
Shiden's home~
As you enter this room you are hipnotized by an angelic sound flowing
from a Grand piano.  Gazing around the room you feel a sense of comfort
and warmth.  There is a quiet mist floating up from the cloud-like floor,
and the tall crystal pillars that surround you let off a gleaming but
gentle light.  Moving closer to the piano you can see the outline of an
angelic figure. The music flows from her fingers like a gentle breeze out
into the room.  As you feel the gentle melodies caressing your mind and
soul, you begin to wonder if you have stepped into a piece of heaven.~
