#4454
Zoren's getaway~
Stepping into this room, the smell of coconut oil entices your nostrils.
As you stroll in you hear a washer running in the backround.  A tall end
Muscular tanned hardbody in a SARONG passes by you with an arm full of
laundry.  As you step towards the porch, your eyes are drawn to tiny
sunbeams dancing on the rippling muscles of two scantly clad men fanning
palm branches up and down.  On the porch you see Zoren sipping on a
Margarita soaking up some rays.  She smiles contentedly as Shiden expertly
massages her feet.
Zoren raises her shades and says, {130}'Come on in and let my men serve you, but
leave the massage man for me. I have plans for him.
{300}Zoren grins evily at you with a twinkle in her eye.~
