#4455
Vel's Cottage~
Walking into this cottage you are surprised to find that there is no wall
to the west side.  As your eyes wander around the room, you look out the
open wall onto a small porch.  Your eyes rest for a moment on the mantle
place over the fireplace.  Upon it you see a plethora of treasures given
to Vel by her Ex-husband Eltharion during their days of courtship.  As you
stand in the middle looking around, you become aware of an aura of
warmth, not actual heat, but rather of openness and friendliness.  You
begin to feel the bond this small cottage represents.   No matter how
apart her travels take her, Vel knows that when she returns to this warm
cottage she can leave the cares of the world behind and just enjoy her
time with her lovely home.  She sometimes sit for hours and hours on the
porch swing, Vel leaning back securely against the strong foundation of
her swing, thinking of nothing and everything, watching the beautiful sunset
pass by.~
