#4457
The Tree-house~
This small tree-house is sheltered from outside forces of evil by the
branches of love and friendship that surround it.  Pink monkeys flit in
and out of sight through  the upper branches of the tree. All who pass
this tree feel the pull of Taveren passing through their lives. On the
wall hangs a picture of the rogueish assassin, Lenroc, protecting his
AesSedai as she wields the power of Blah! healing all who pass her way.
Together these three companions make up a force  impenetrable by any
other malignant beings or forces.  This young couple, full of fire, is
perfectly matched in both ability and temperament.  Lenroc and Taveren's
brash willingness to attack any evil, no matter how insurmountable, is
balanced by the firm and wise hand of Taveren's older sister AesSedai.
Teamwork and friendship guide these perfectly matched adventurers on a
quest against all odds, to restore good to all the realms.~
