detail.  The faint smell of wood polish is refreshing, as are the paintings
and etchings that line the solid totara wall panels. The thick merino wool
carpets have only recently been beaten, and the banisters leading upstairs
shine with wear.  You feel your spirits raise for some reason, and you find
yourself thinking of absent friends.~
