Wall Hanging~
The wall hanging is made from very expensive wool, and the colours are
vibrant enough to make you wander if it might be magically enhanced in
some way. The picture shows a unicorn in a green valley. It's a very old
wall hanging, but the scene looks hauntingly familiar.~
